{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-032",
    "title": "失去名字的人"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_182",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“进入门内之前，”慧闻说，“必须先说出你愿意保留的名字。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "天门第一声鸣响后，回川城的雪停了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5657,
          "end": 5657
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "停下的不是雪，而是所有人的时间。街边飘落的雪花悬在半空，火盆里的灰烬凝成灰白色的线，连陆照临眼角滑下的泪也停在半途。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5659,
          "end": 5659
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "只有天门仍在开启。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5661,
          "end": 5661
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "它没有门扇，也没有门框，天空裂缝向两侧缓慢拉开，露出一片没有星辰的黑暗。黑暗中漂浮着无数灯火，每一盏灯下都站着一个模糊的人影。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5663,
          "end": 5663
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它在召回被删去的人。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5665,
          "end": 5665
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“召回之后呢？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5667,
          "end": 5667
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“回到记忆里，或者回到人间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5669,
          "end": 5669
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有什么区别？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5671,
          "end": 5671
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记忆里的人不会再离开，人间的人不会再保持原样。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5673,
          "end": 5673
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向街道。时间恢复流动，居民同时发出惊呼。有人认出了失踪多年的亲人，有人看见陌生人站在自家门口，彼此的记忆重叠成一片混乱。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5675,
          "end": 5675
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜冲上钟楼：“城外的灵气在倒灌。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5677,
          "end": 5677
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "远处山脉亮起青光，河流开始逆向。回川城的房屋从地基处裂开，裂缝中长出半透明的树根，树根缠住门窗，把屋内的人拖向城心。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5679,
          "end": 5679
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“先救人。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5681,
          "end": 5681
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离已经冲下街道。她的债契黑纹虽然被铜针截断，颈侧仍留着一圈深色印记。她用铜针挑断树根，将被困的孩子交给家人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5683,
          "end": 5683
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "可那名父亲看见孩子后，忽然哭喊：“这不是我的女儿！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5685,
          "end": 5685
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "孩子抬头：“爹，我记得你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5687,
          "end": 5687
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不记得你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5689,
          "end": 5689
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离一掌击在父亲胸口，逼他后退：“记忆不一致，不代表人是假的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5691,
          "end": 5691
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "父亲仍在摇头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5693,
          "end": 5693
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临跑到街心，将无名小灯放在地面。小灯没有火，却释放出一圈稳定的白光。白光经过的人，记忆冲突暂时减弱。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5695,
          "end": 5695
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“范围太小。”叶观澜从钟楼跃下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5697,
          "end": 5697
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把灯带到城门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5699,
          "end": 5699
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“城门正在塌。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5701,
          "end": 5701
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就先撑住。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5703,
          "end": 5703
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜拔刀斩向裂缝。刀光化作黑色弧线，暂时封住城墙上的缺口。灵气倒灌却越来越强，黑色弧线表面迅速结霜。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5705,
          "end": 5705
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻站在钟楼下，敲响无相铜镜。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5707,
          "end": 5707
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "镜声传遍回川城，居民的名字牌重新浮出。可每一块牌子上同时出现两个名字，一个属于现在，一个属于三百年前。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5709,
          "end": 5709
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们开始重叠。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5711,
          "end": 5711
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“能分开吗？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5713,
          "end": 5713
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“只能让他们选择保留哪一个。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5715,
          "end": 5715
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果他们都不想失去？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5717,
          "end": 5717
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就会被天门一起带走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5719,
          "end": 5719
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城中心传来哭喊。昨夜抱着孩子的妇人站在广场，身旁多了一个与她相貌相同的女人。两个女人同时说：“我是她。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5721,
          "end": 5721
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向无相铜镜。镜中显示，两人的记忆都完整，却来自不同年代。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5723,
          "end": 5723
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“天门把过去的人带回来了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5725,
          "end": 5725
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是带回。”慧闻说，“是把过去的影子放进现在。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5727,
          "end": 5727
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第二声天门鸣响在此时落下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5729,
          "end": 5729
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天空黑暗中，一盏盏灯开始下降。每盏灯落地，便有一段旧城景象覆盖现实。街道变成三百年前的石路，房屋变成已经不存在的楼阁，居民被迫站进陌生的过去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5731,
          "end": 5731
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离站在两条重叠的街道之间。她看见一个年轻男人从旧城门走来，正是她叔父的模样。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5733,
          "end": 5733
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把灯给我。”男人说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5735,
          "end": 5735
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不是他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5737,
          "end": 5737
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我是他被留下的部分。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5739,
          "end": 5739
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你还记得自己的名字吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5741,
          "end": 5741
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男人沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5743,
          "end": 5743
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离将铜针抵在他胸口：“说出来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5745,
          "end": 5745
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾……长……”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5747,
          "end": 5747
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "最后一个字没有出现。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5749,
          "end": 5749
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "债契黑纹从顾长离颈侧重新生长，向那道影子缠去。影子没有躲，任由黑纹穿过身体。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5751,
          "end": 5751
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你的名字缺一笔。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5753,
          "end": 5753
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“家已经不记得我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5990,
          "end": 5990
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我记得。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-074",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5992,
          "end": 5992
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三声天门余鸣再次震动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-075",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5994,
          "end": 5994
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟的身影被拉向黑暗，脚下却留下半枚青色脚印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-076",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5996,
          "end": 5996
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抬起铜环。铜环内侧的字迹变成了另一行：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-077",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5998,
          "end": 5998
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“见证者一人，门楔可落。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-078",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6000,
          "end": 6000
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你要作证？”她问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-079",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6002,
          "end": 6002
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-080",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6004,
          "end": 6004
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你会失去父亲最后的完整记忆。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-081",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6006,
          "end": 6006
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向天门：“至少他会回来一部分。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-082",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6008,
          "end": 6008
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜挡住玄霄宗冲来的修士，慧闻则将无相铜镜悬在钟楼上空。镜面照出陆照临的影子，影子里只有一个名字：陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-083",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6010,
          "end": 6010
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“进入门内之前，”慧闻说，“必须先说出你愿意保留的名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-084",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6012,
          "end": 6012
        }
      }
    ],
